{"2063710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mars 2055", "steam_appid": 2063710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><strong>Loneliness is the only feeling you may ever know?</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up alone on a planet that appears to be Mars. There are no instructions. There is no help. There is only the suit on your back and the silence of a dead world. Finding your way home is the goal, but staying alive is the challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the Mission</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join over 10,000 survivors who have already braved the Red Planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rated 4.3/5 on mobile!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully playable on Steam Deck and supports Xbox Controllers.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive, Repair, and Escape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mars 2055 is a first-person solo adventure where environmental storytelling meets complex problem-solving. In this desolate sandbox, you aren't just a passenger—you are the technician, the detective, and the survivor.<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Mystery:</strong> Search for clues left behind by those who came before—be they human or artificial.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repair &amp; Restore:</strong> Fix broken equipment and restore damaged systems to regain control of the base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secure Access:</strong> Use your findings to bypass security and access locked sectors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MacGyver Mechanics:</strong> Combine seemingly unrelated items into usable modules to overcome obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Stakes Sandbox:</strong> Move carefully; a single miscalculation could destroy the entire base.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Where does the adventure come from? It comes from the stories you tell yourself, alone, inside your head.&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><strong>Loneliness is the only feeling you may ever know?</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up alone on a planet that appears to be Mars. There are no instructions. There is no help. There is only the suit on your back and the silence of a dead world. Finding your way home is the goal, but staying alive is the challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the Mission</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join over 10,000 survivors who have already braved the Red Planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rated 4.3/5 on mobile!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully playable on Steam Deck and supports Xbox Controllers.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive, Repair, and Escape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mars 2055 is a first-person solo adventure where environmental storytelling meets complex problem-solving. In this desolate sandbox, you aren't just a passenger—you are the technician, the detective, and the survivor.<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Mystery:</strong> Search for clues left behind by those who came before—be they human or artificial.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repair &amp; Restore:</strong> Fix broken equipment and restore damaged systems to regain control of the base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secure Access:</strong> Use your findings to bypass security and access locked sectors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MacGyver Mechanics:</strong> Combine seemingly unrelated items into usable modules to overcome obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Stakes Sandbox:</strong> Move carefully; a single miscalculation could destroy the entire base.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Where does the adventure come from? It comes from the stories you tell yourself, alone, inside your head.&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "short_description": "A first-person solo survival adventure set on a desolate Martian base. Search for clues, repair critical systems, and solve complex environmental puzzles to find a way home before your life support—or your luck—runs out.", "supported_languages": "English", "reviews": "“This game is really fun, this is the only horror game, you have to play this game”<br>5/5 – Google Play<br><br>“Extremely good and unsettling... aaa...”<br>4/5 – Google Play<br><br>“A very beautiful and fun game. Who's with me? Give it a like.”<br>4/5 – Google Play<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063710/21d8d3a843b7e5dab82b5958107687da23ba2ad3/header.jpg?t=1773087509", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063710/cfad927dbec957bb627c0ebdf33bc8d93bcd40ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773087509", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063710/cfad927dbec957bb627c0ebdf33bc8d93bcd40ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773087509", "website": "https://burningthumb.com/games/mars-2055/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.0 GHz (e.g., Intel Core i3 or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000 or better / NVIDIA GeForce GTX 660<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad Core 3.0 GHz+ (Intel i5 or equivalen